。但切换阶段是在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"。我不能在同一个回复中既调用工具又切换阶段。根据行为准则，我需要在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换阶段。所以，我应该先分析用户意图：用户想要配置报警。当前阶段ANALYZE_INTENT没有配置报警的工具。因此，我需要切换到CONFIG_ALARM阶段。我可以在回复中说明需要切换到配置报警阶段。但也许我可以先调用查询工具来确认点位是否存在，然后在回复中切换阶段？不过，行为准则没有明确禁止在同一个回复中既调用工具又切换阶段。但通常，切换阶段是在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"，这可能会在工具调用之后。我可以先调用list_points来确认PT101存在，然后在同一个回复中切换到CONFIG_ALARM。但需要注意的是，当前工作流上下文是workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。这可能意味着我们处于报警配置的工作流中，步骤是发现点位。所以，也许应该先查询点位列表。让我先调用manage_points来列出点位，看看是否有PT101。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2531, "output_tokens": 258, "latency_ms": 7894.894300028682, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要给PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。现在进入CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可用工具有manage_alarms（支持create_analog_alarm, set_threshold, disable_alarm, delete_alarm, create_digital_alarm, enable_alarm）和manage_points（仅支持list_points）。根据用户需求，需要创建一个模拟量报警。报警ID需要唯一，比如\"alarm_pt101_high\"。标签是\"PT101\"，高限2.0，低限null，死区默认0，优先级中等。调用manage_alarms，action为create_analog_alarm。先确认一下是否有现成的报警，但用户明确要求创建，所以直接创建。调用工具。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2863, "output_tokens": 271, "latency_ms": 5995.680499996524, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想为PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。当前是CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可用工具有manage_alarms和manage_points（仅list_points）。之前尝试创建模拟量报警时出现了模式错误，因为low_limit参数传入了\"None\"字符串，应该是null或不传。需要重新创建，正确设置low_limit为null或省略。调用manage_alarms的create_analog_alarm操作，id设为\"alarm_pt101_high\"，tag为\"PT101\"，high_limit为2.0，low_limit不传或设为null，deadband默认0.0，priority为\"medium\"。根据之前的错误信息，可能是因为low_limit被解析为字符串。应该不传low_limit参数，因为它是可选的，默认null。现在重新调用。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4578, "output_tokens": 230, "latency_ms": 9688.261199975386, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我再次尝试创建报警，但仍然遇到相同的错误。错误信息指出\"create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\"。这表明系统期望low_limit是一个数字，但我可能传递了字符串或其他格式。\n\n让我检查一下参数：我在调用时没有提供low_limit参数，但系统似乎仍然在尝试解析它。可能工具在内部默认设置了一个非数字的值。让我显式地设置low_limit为null，看看是否能解决问题。\n\n我需要确保low_limit是数字或null，而不是字符串。让我重新调用，显式设置low_limit为null。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4882, "output_tokens": 229, "latency_ms": 5825.973100028932, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The user is trying to create an analog alarm for PT101 with a high limit of 2.0 and medium priority. The error indicates that the \"low_limit\" parameter is being parsed incorrectly as a string instead of a number or null.\n\nLooking at the schema, low_limit can be either a number or null. The error message suggests that somewhere in the system, it's trying to parse \"None\" as a number, which fails.\n\nLet me try a different approach - perhaps I should explicitly pass low_limit as null (not \"None\" as a string). In JSON, null is a valid value. Let me try with explicit null."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5185, "output_tokens": 222, "latency_ms": 5321.520199999213, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The user is still getting the same error. Let me look at the tool definition again. The issue seems to be with how the low_limit parameter is being passed. Looking at the schema:\n\n```\n\"low_limit\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Low Limit\"},\n```\n\nThe schema says low_limit can be a number or null. The error message \"Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number\" suggests the system is receiving a string \"None\" instead of an actual null value.\n\nLet me try to use the tool correctly by not including low_limit at all, since it has a default of null."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5481, "output_tokens": 141, "latency_ms": 6650.205100013409, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Let me try a different approach. I'll use a proper null value instead of the string \"None\". In JSON, null is represented differently t