能，并设置为\"变化存储\"模式。\n\n当前工作流是HistoryQuery，步骤是check_history_config。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT。我需要检查当前可用工具：manage_history（列出历史记录配置）和manage_points（列出点位）。这两个工具目前只支持查询操作（list_history和list_points），没有创建或更新历史记录配置的功能。\n\n根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n要配置历史记录，我需要切换到CONFIG_HISTORY阶段。但首先，我需要确认PT101点位是否存在。让我先调用manage_points来列出点位，检查PT101是否存在。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 971, "output_tokens": 266, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 8613.178799976595}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "3caff399-8351-48fd-a3a1-d5b64793ad7c", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-003", "text": "给PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:16:32.576Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:17:02.678Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:16:32.576Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:16:47.477Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:16:47.477Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:17:02.678Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "None"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.9055000264197588, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.777199980802834, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "delete_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.153099990915507, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.006900052540004253, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 4, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "disable_alarm", "delete_alarm", "create_digital_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["update_point", "create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_circle", "apply_flow_layout"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts", "create_script"]}], "visible_count": 4, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_analog_alarm", "args": {"action": "create_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_pt101_high", "tag": "PT101", "high_limit": "2.0", "low_limit": "None", "deadband": "0.0", "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "create_analog_alarm.low_limit: Input should be a valid number, unable to parse string as a number", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7881999481469393, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 158, "latency_ms": 8577.9870999977, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求为PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。当前工作流是AlarmConfig，步骤是discover_points。我需要先了解现有的点位情况，确认PT101是否存在。我可以调用manage_points的list_points来查看所有点位。不过，用户的需求是配置报警，这可能涉及到报警配置阶段。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可切换的下一阶段包括CONFIG_ALARM。但首先我需要确认PT101点位是否存在。所以，我应该先调用list_points工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1175, "output_tokens": 90, "latency_ms": 6317.2149999882095, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "看来type_filter必须指定具体类型。我可以不提供type_filter参数，或者提供null值。让我试试不提供type_filter参数，或者提供null值。从错误信息看，它期望的是'analog', 'digital'或'string'，但也许允许null。让我尝试不指定type_filter参数。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2169, "output_tokens": 144, "latency_ms": 5115.526799985673, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户已明确进入了CONFIG_ALARM阶段，当前可用的工具是manage_alarms和manage_points（仅限list_points）。用户要求为PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。\n\n我需要先确认PT101这个点位是否存在。虽然刚才list_points调用失败了，但我可以再次尝试，这次正确指定类型。PT101听起来像是一个压力变送器，可能是模拟量点位。所以我先尝试用analog类型过滤。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3755, "output_tokens": 326, "latency_ms": 8204.11759999115, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前可用的工具中，manage_points 只有 update_point 和 create_point 两个 action，没有 list_points。所以不能列出点位。\n\n用户要求为 PT101 配置高限报警，阈值 2.0，中等优先级。这意味着 PT101 应该是一个已存在的模拟量点位。如果没有，可能需要先创建它。但用户说的是“配置”，暗示它已经存在。\n\n既然无法列出点位，我应该假设 PT101 存在，然后直接创建报警。如果 PT101 不存在，创建报警可能会失败。\n\n使用 manage_alarms 的 create_analog_alarm action。需要提供 id, tag, action。还有 high_limit, low_limit, deadband, priority。\n\nid 可以设为 \"alarm_pt101_high\"。tag 是 \"PT101\"。high_limit 是 2.0。low_limit 可以是 null（因为只要求高限报警）。deadband 默认为 0.0。priority 是 \"medium\"。\n\n那么，调用 manage_alarms。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8066, "output_tokens": 718, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 30101.926299976185}, "judge": null}
