points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.42290001874789596, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:36e31d14527f0872ccb5f51950799da65fb09ef75692732e9254423bf83e5608", "final_hash": "sha256:2192e1b2659741b1b61d6ac77a9756556233fae99d7698e53e0d9ecf4fd5f5aa", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1614, "output_tokens": 385, "latency_ms": 8219.228199974168, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析一下您的需求：\n\n1. **修改主监控页面背景色** - 当前阶段我只能查看页面列表，无法修改页面属性（如背景色）。这个操作需要在 **DEPLOY** 阶段才能执行。\n2. **校验项目** - 这个我可以立即执行。\n\n让我先帮您查看当前有哪些页面，同时启动项目校验：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to:\n1. Change the background color of the main monitoring page to white\n2. Re-validate the project\n\nLet me analyze this:\n\n1. For changing the background color of a page - I need to use the `manage_pages` tool. However, looking at the available actions, I can only `list_pages` currently. There's no action to modify/update page properties like background color. So I cannot directly make this change.\n\n2. For validating the project - I can use `deployment` tool with `validate_project` action.\n\nLet me first list the pages to see what's available, and then I'll need to explain to the user that I cannot modify page properties with the current available tools.\n\nActually, let me re-read the available actions:\n- manage_pages: current allowed actions: list_pages\n\nSo I can only list pages, not modify them. I should inform the user that I cannot modify the page background color with the current tools available.\n\nHowever, I can still validate the project as requested.\n\nLet me first list the pages to show the user what pages exist, and then run the validation. I'll also explain that I cannot modify the page background color.\n\nActually, since these are independent operations, I can call them in parallel."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1614, "output_tokens": 369, "latency_ms": 9897.200700012036, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "---\n\n## 📋 执行结果\n\n### 1. 页面列表\n| 页面ID | 页面名称 |\n|--------|----------|\n| main_page | 主页面 |\n\n### 2. 项目校验结果 ✅ 通过\n- **状态**: validated（已校验）\n- **错误数**: 0\n- **部署ID**: default\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 关于修改背景色\n\n**无法在当前阶段执行修改操作。** 当前处于 `VALIDATE` 阶段，只能查看页面列表和校验项目，没有修改页面属性（如背景色）的工具可用。\n\n如需修改\"主页面\"的背景色为白色，请先切换到可编辑页面的阶段。您可以在回复中指定切换阶段，或者告知我是否需要先完成校验后进入部署流程。\n\n---\n\n**当前项目已通过校验**，如果您需要：\n- **部署项目** → 我可以执行下装操作\n- **修改页面属性** → 需要切换到对应阶段\n\n请问您接下来想怎么操作？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "Okay, the results show:\n1. There's one page: \"主页面\" (main page) with id \"main_page\"\n2. The project validation passed successfully - no errors, status is \"validated\"\n\nNow I need to explain to the user:\n- The project has been validated successfully\n- I cannot modify the page background color in the current VALIDATE phase - this needs to be done in a different phase (DEPLOY or possibly ANALYZE_INTENT)\n\nSince the current stage is VALIDATE and I can only list_pages, I cannot modify page properties. I should inform the user about this limitation and suggest switching to a different phase if they want to modify the page."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3228, "output_tokens": 754, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18125.95479999436}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "c0d49fae-ea6b-4e00-8086-efa38d564a4d", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-008", "text": "帮忙建个页面", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:19:41.746Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:19:49.229Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:19:41.746Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:19:49.229Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2908, "output_tokens": 328, "latency_ms": 7477.301099977922, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我可以帮您创建一个新的 HMI 页面。请提供以下信息：\n\n1. **页面 ID**：页面的唯一标识符（例如：\"main_page\"、\"overview\"）\n2. **页面名称**：页面的显示名称（例如：\"主界面\"、\"系统总览\"）\n3. **分辨率**：可选，默认为 1920×1080 像素\n4. **背景色**：可选，默认为白色 (#FFFFFF)\n\n您想要创建什么页面？", "reasoning": "用户想创建一个页面。我需要使用 manage_pages 工具，action 为 \"create_page\"。但用户没有提供页面的详细信息，如 ID、名称、分辨率和背景色。我需要询问这些信息。\n\n根据行为准则，如果信息不足，我应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。目前没有查询页面的工具，所以应该向用户确认。\n\n我可以先调用 list_pages 来查看现有页面，但这并不是创建新页面所必需的。不过，了解现有页面可能有助于避免 ID 冲突。但用户只是要求创建页面，并没有提到查看现有页面。\n\n我应该询问用户需要创建什么页面，包括 ID、名称等信息。\n\n但首先，我需要确认用户是否想创建新页面。用户说\"帮忙建个页面\"，这明确表示要创建一个新页面。\n\n所以，我需要询问更多细节：页面 ID、名称、分辨率（默认 1920x1080）和背景色（默认白色）。\n\n我将询问用户这些信息。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2908, "output_tokens": 328, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 7483.006900001783}, "judge": null}
