{"trace_id": "a2205e04-9a23-49ea-a2be-f42377c9f539", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-010", "text": "给那几个温度加上报警", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:00.222Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:16.664Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:00.222Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:07.793Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:07.793Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:16.664Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6553000421263278, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 953, "output_tokens": 173, "latency_ms": 7568.40970000485, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您查看项目中有哪些温度点位，以便进行报警配置。", "reasoning": "用户想要给\"那几个温度\"加上报警配置。这说明用户想要对温度点位进行报警配置。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，工作流上下文是 AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。这意味着我们需要先发现/了解现有的温度点位，然后才能配置报警。\n\n为了完成这个任务，我需要：\n1. 先查看现有的点位，找出温度相关的点位\n2. 然后根据用户的意图配置报警\n\n让我先调用 manage_points 工具来列出所有点位，或者筛选出温度相关的点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2017, "output_tokens": 284, "latency_ms": 8864.791799976956, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中**没有找到任何温度点位**，无法直接添加报警。\n\n报警需要依附于已存在的点位才能创建。请问您是否需要：\n\n1. **先创建温度点位**，然后再配置报警？\n2. 或者您指的是**其他已经存在的点位**？\n\n如果需要创建温度点位，我可以帮您切换到点位配置阶段。请告诉我：\n- 温度点位的**名称/标签**（如 `TEMP_101`, `TEMP_102` 等）\n- 大概有**几个**温度点位需要配置", "reasoning": "用户想要给温度点位添加报警，但刚才查询结果显示当前没有任何模拟量点位（count: 0, points: []）。\n\n我需要告知用户当前项目中没有找到温度点位，无法配置报警。应该询问用户是否需要先创建点位，或者用户是否指的是其他类型的点位。\n\n根据当前阶段 CONFIG_ALARM，我只能使用 manage_alarms 和 manage_points（仅 list_points）工具。由于没有点位存在，我无法创建报警。\n\n我应该：\n1. 告知用户当前没有找到温度点位\n2. 询问用户是否需要先创建点位\n3. 如果需要创建点位，可能需要切换到 CREATE_POINTS 阶段\n\n让我回复用户说明情况。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2970, "output_tokens": 457, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16442.44280003477}, "judge": null}
