{"trace_id": "fb82027c-5c3c-4f8f-b9f8-15041342f581", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-010", "text": "给那几个温度加上报警", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:20.364Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:53.787Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:20.365Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:26.085Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:26.085Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:38.687Z"}, {"name": "BIND_POINTS", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:38.687Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:52.022Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:52.022Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:53.787Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.0042000212706625, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 953, "output_tokens": 173, "latency_ms": 5717.60659996653, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求\"给那几个温度加上报警\"，这涉及到报警配置。当前工作流上下文显示 workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。这意味着我们在报警配置工作流的\"发现点位\"步骤。\n\n用户提到\"那几个温度\"，我需要先了解现有的点位情况，看看有哪些温度相关的点位。我可以使用 manage_points 工具来列出所有点位，或者过滤出温度相关的点位。不过工具的 type_filter 只有 analog、digital、string，没有专门的\"温度\"过滤，但温度通常属于模拟量(analog)。我可以先列出所有点位，然后筛选出温度相关的。\n\n让我先调用 list_points 查看所有点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2017, "output_tokens": 440, "latency_ms": 12594.380600028671, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前系统中还没有配置任何点位（tags）。要添加温度报警，首先需要存在温度相关的点位。\n\n您提到的\"那几个温度\"具体是指哪些点位？如果您知道具体的点位名称，我可以直接为您创建报警。如果系统中确实还没有温度点位，您需要先创建这些点位，然后才能配置报警。\n\n如果您需要先创建温度点位，我可以帮您切换到点位配置阶段。\n\nnext_state: BIND_POINTS", "reasoning": "当前系统显示有0个点位，我需要告诉用户系统中目前没有配置任何点位。要添加报警，首先需要有点位存在。用户提到\"那几个温度\"，可能假设系统中已经有温度点位，但实际上没有。我需要解释这个情况并询问下一步该怎么做。\n\n根据工作流上下文，当前阶段是CONFIG_ALARM，可切换的下一阶段包括BIND_POINTS等。由于没有点位，无法创建报警，可能需要先进入BIND_POINTS阶段来创建点位。或者，用户可能需要先创建点位。我应该向用户说明情况并建议下一步行动。由于没有点位，创建报警的工具无法使用。我需要询问用户是否要创建点位，或者是否有其他信息。\n\n回复应该用中文，因为用户使用中文。我需要说明当前没有温度点位，因此无法添加报警。询问用户是否需要先创建温度点位，或者是否知道具体的点位名称。\n\n另外，根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适阶段。这里，由于没有点位，我们无法在CONFIG_ALARM阶段完成任务，可能需要切换到BIND_POINTS阶段来创建点位。但用户可能只是不知道点位已经存在，或者点位名称不同。我应该先询问。\n\n回复结构：首先说明查询结果显示没有点位；然后询问用户是否需要先创建温度点位，或者是否知道具体的点位名称；最后建议如果需要创建点位，可以切换到BIND_POINTS阶段。\n\n这样既符合工作流，又遵循了行为准则。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2478, "output_tokens": 379, "latency_ms": 13329.50259995414, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前系统中还没有配置任何点位。要添加温度报警，我需要先为您创建温度点位。\n\n请提供以下信息：\n1. 需要创建几个温度点位？\n2. 每个点位的名称（例如：TEMP_001, TEMP_002）？\n3. 测量单位（如℃）？\n4. 量程范围（例如：0-200）？\n5. 其他属性（如描述、小数位数等）？\n\n或者，如果您希望使用一些示例点位进行演示，我也可以为您创建一些标准的温度点位。\n\n请告诉我您的具体需求。", "reasoning": "现在处于 BIND_POINTS 阶段，可用的工具有 manage_points 和 manage_alarms。用户想要给温度点位添加报警，但目前没有点位。首先需要创建温度点位。用户没有提供具体的点位信息，比如有多少个温度点位、它们的名称、范围等。我需要询问这些细节。\n\n我可以先询问用户关于温度点位的具体信息：需要创建哪些温度点位？名称、单位、范围等。然后创建这些点位，之后再添加报警。\n\n但是，用户可能期望我自动创建一些示例点位？根据行为准则，信息不足时应先查询或向用户确认。所以，我需要询问用户关于温度点位的详细信息。\n\n另外，也可以先列出所有点位，但之前已经列过，是空的。所以，直接询问用户。\n\n我会用中文回复，因为用户用中文提问。需要询问：温度点位的数量、名称、单位、范围（如0-100℃）等。然后才能创建点位。之后，再询问报警设置：高限、低限、优先级等。\n\n现在回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 5448, "output_tokens": 992, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 33422.421299968846}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "48f6f77b-5748-46fe-a62e-cb87a936bbc7", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-010", "text": "给那几个温度加上报警", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:28.654Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:03.991Z", "total_turns": 6, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:28.654Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:38.497Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:38.498Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:03.991Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "None"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4727999805472791, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5126000032760203, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "delete_alarm", "enable_alarm", "disable_alarm", "set_threshold", "create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3125999830663204, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.005499983672052622, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 4, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "delete_alarm", "enable_alarm", "disable_alarm", "set_threshold", "create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["delete_point", "create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["delete_widget", "create_text"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8245999924838543, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 5, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "delete_alarm", "enable_alarm", "disable_alarm", "set_threshold", "create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["delete_point", "create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["delete_widget", "create_text"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.914699980057776, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 953, "output_tokens": 139, "latency_ms": 7042.624900001101, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户说\"给那几个温度加上报警\"，这表明用户想为一些温度点位配置报警。当前工作流是AlarmConfig，步骤是discover_points。我需要先了解有哪些点位可用，特别是温度相关的点位。\n\n当前可用工具是manage_pages（列出页面）和manage_points（列出点位）。为了发现温度点位，我应该调用manage_points来列出所有点位，然后筛选出温度相关的。\n\n让我先调用manage_points来查看所有点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1142, "output_tokens": 79, "latency_ms": 2794.316399958916, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "看来type_filter参数不能是null，必须指定为\"analog\"、\"digital\"或\"string\"。温度点位通常是模拟量（analog），所以我用\"analog\"过滤器。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2125, "output_tokens": 117, "latency_ms": 4392.16019999003, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户说\"给那几个温度加上报警\"，并且系统提示我已进入CONFIG_ALARM阶段。让我先查看有哪些点位可用，然后为温度点位配置报警。我需要先列出点位来了解哪些是温度相关的。在CONFIG_ALARM阶段，我应该使用manage_alarms工具。但首先需要知道有哪些点位。让我用正确的格式调用list_points。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3716, "output_tokens": 56, "latency_ms": 3672.4960999563336, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要先查看当前有哪些点位（tags），特别是温度相关的点位，然后才能为它们创建报警。让我尝试列出所有点位。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3844, "output_tokens": 161, "latency_ms": 4732.627900026273, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要重新理解当前的情况。用户说\"给那几个温度加上报警\"，这表明系统中已经存在一些温度点位。我需要先了解这些温度点位是什么，然后才能为它们创建报警。\n\n让我尝试列出所有点位，但看起来list_points需要一个type_filter参数。我应该使用manage_pages来查看现有页面，或者直接询问用户温度点位的名称。\n\n实际上，从错误信息来看，list_points需要type_filter参数，我应该提供有效的值。让我尝试使用\"analog\"作为type_filter来列出模拟量点位（温度通常是模拟量）。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4077, "output_tokens": 425, "latency_ms": 12661.092099966481, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要知道您希望为哪些温度点位添加报警。请提供以下信息：\n\n1. 温度点位的名称（tag），例如 \"TEMP_101\", \"TEMP_102\" 等\n2. 每个温度点位的报警要求：\n   - 高限报警值（high_limit）\n   - 低限报警值（low_limit） \n   - 是否需要死区（deadband）\n   - 报警优先级（high/medium/low）\n\n例如，您可以这样告诉我：\n- TEMP_101：高限 80°C，低限 20°C，死区 2°C，优先级高\n- TEMP_102：高限 90°C，无低限，死区 1°C，优先级中\n\n请提供您想添加报警的具体温度点位信息。", "reasoning": "看起来manage_points工具的list_points动作的参数有问题。根据schema，list_points动作没有列出任何必需参数，但可能有一些参数是可选的。让我看看manage_points的schema定义。\n\n从schema看，manage_points有一个oneOf，只包含delete_point和create_point两种操作，没有list_points操作。这可能是问题所在。不过，从之前的错误信息看，工具似乎支持list_points，但需要正确的参数。\n\n让我尝试调用manage_points时只提供action参数，看看会发生什么。但schema显示没有list_points选项，这可能意味着该动作当前不被支持，或者schema不完整。\n\n根据用户的需求，他们想为\"那几个温度\"添加报警。这意味着用户期望有一些已经存在的温度点位。我需要询问用户温度点位的名称，因为当前没有可用的工具来列出点位。\n\n实际上，根据行为准则第4点：\"若信息不足,先调用查询类工具或向用户确认\"。既然没有列出点位的工具可用，我应该向用户确认温度点位的名称。\n\n让我向用户询问具体的温度点位名称，以便为它们创建报警。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15857, "output_tokens": 977, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 35337.31259999331}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "143bef12-4b41-47e6-ba3a-15301ca71671", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-011", "text": "把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:50.839Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:09.028Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:50.840Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:09.028Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3217, "output_tokens": 692, "latency_ms": 18178.539699991234, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要更多信息来完成泵1到马达3的绑定。请确认以下细节：\n\n1. **页面ID**：主画面的页面ID是什么？（例如：\"main_page\"、\"home\"、\"overview\"等）\n2. **控件ID**：泵1的控件ID是什么？（例如：\"pump1\"、\"pump_01\"等）\n3. **绑定属性**：您希望将马达3绑定到泵1的哪个属性？（例如：\"value\"、\"state\"、\"speed\"、\"color\"等）\n4. **点位标签**：马达3在SCADA系统中的标签名是什么？（例如：\"motor3\"、\"motor_3\"、\"MOTOR_3\"等）\n\n例如，如果您想要将马达3的值绑定到泵1的显示状态，操作可能是：\n- 页面：main_page\n- 控件：pump1  \n- 属性：value\n- 标签：motor3\n\n请提供这些信息，我将为您完成绑定操作。", "reasoning": "用户说\"把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上\"。这是一个中文请求，意思是\"将主画面的泵1绑定到马达3上\"。这听起来像是要将泵1这个控件绑定到马达3这个点位（tag）上。\n\n我需要理解这个请求：\n- \"主画面\"可能是一个页面名称或ID，可能是\"main\"或类似的东西\n- \"泵1\"可能是一个widget（控件），可能是\"pump1\"或\"pump_1\"\n- \"马达3\"可能是一个SCADA点位（tag），可能是\"motor3\"或\"motor_3\"\n\n当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要分析用户意图并调用合适的工具。用户想要将控件绑定到点位，这应该使用manage_pages工具中的bind_point动作。\n\n但首先我需要确认一些信息：\n1. 页面ID（主画面）是什么？\n2. 控件ID（泵1）是什么？\n3. 要绑定的属性是什么？（可能是\"value\"或\"state\"）\n4. 点位标签（马达3）是什么？\n\n由于信息不足，我应该先询问用户确认这些细节。不过，我可以假设一些常见的命名约定，但最好还是确认一下。\n\n让我检查当前阶段的可用工具：manage_graphics、manage_pages、manage_scripts、manage_alarms。对于绑定操作，我需要使用manage_pages的bind_point动作。\n\n我需要决定是否要切换到ASK_USER阶段来询问更多信息，还是直接尝试绑定。根据行为准则第4条：\"若信息不足,先调用查询类工具或向用户确认\"。这里没有查询类工具，所以我应该向用户确认。\n\n我将在回复中询问具体细节，然后如果用户确认，再执行绑定操作。不过，我可以先尝试一些合理的默认值。\n\n让我思考一下：主画面的ID可能是\"main_page\"或\"main\"，泵1的widget_id可能是\"pump1\"或\"pump_1\"，马达3的标签可能是\"motor3\"或\"motor_3\"，绑定的属性可能是\"value\"。\n\n但为了安全起见，我还是询问一下。我会在回复中询问这些细节。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3217, "output_tokens": 692, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18188.532300002407}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "bd0ec345-84f7-47ce-9250-7c0f9bff82c0", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-011", "text": "把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:05.895Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:18.290Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:05.895Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:18.290Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3217, "output_tokens": 373, "latency_ms": 12385.36049996037, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要确认几个关键信息才能完成绑定配置：\n\n1. **页面ID** - \"主画面\"的页面ID是什么？（例如：`main_page`、`homepage` 等）\n2. **组件ID** - \"泵1\"的 widget ID 是什么？（例如：`pump_1`、`PUMP_01` 等）\n3. **绑定属性** - 您希望绑定到泵的哪个属性？常见的有：\n   - `running` - 运行状态（开/关）\n   - `speed` - 转速\n   - `value` - 通用数值\n\n请提供这些信息，我就可以为您完成泵1与马达3的绑定配置。", "reasoning": "用户想要将主画面上的\"泵1\"组件绑定到\"马达3\"这个点位上。我需要调用manage_pages工具的bind_point操作来完成这个绑定。\n\n不过，我需要确认一些关键信息：\n1. page_id - 主画面的页面ID是什么？\n2. widget_id - 泵1组件的widget ID是什么？\n3. property - 要绑定的属性是什么？对于泵组件，通常绑定的是\"running\"、\"speed\"或\"value\"等属性\n\n用户说的是\"泵1绑到马达3\"，这里：\n- 泵1 = 组件widget\n- 马达3 = 应该是SCADA点位tag\n\n但我需要知道：\n1. 页面ID - 用户说\"主画面\"，但我不知道具体的page_id\n2. widget_id - 泵1的具体ID\n3. 要绑定的属性 - 是\"running\"、\"speed\"还是其他？\n\n我应该向用户确认这些信息。让我询问用户这些必要信息。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3217, "output_tokens": 373, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 12395.526300009806}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "af94acd0-2ff7-4055-9c1c-e3d96edc0ab0", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-010", "text": "给那几个温度加上报警", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:53.788Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:19.152Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:53.789Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:58.654Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:22:58.654Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:19.152Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.937800039537251, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_analog_alarm", "delete_alarm", "enable_alarm", "disable_alarm", "set_threshold", "create_digital_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7964000105857849, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.004300032742321491, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 953, "output_tokens": 108, "latency_ms": 4862.721199984662, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要给\"那几个温度\"添加报警配置。当前工作流是AlarmConfig，步骤是discover_points。我需要先了解现有的温度点有哪些，才能为它们配置报警。\n\n首先，我需要调用manage_points工具来列出所有点位，特别是温度相关的点。我可以用list_points action，不需要type_filter，因为温度点可能是analog类型。让我先查看所有点。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1952, "output_tokens": 140, "latency_ms": 8457.146700005978, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想为\"那几个温度\"添加报警，但系统返回的点列表为空（count: 0）。这意味着当前项目中可能没有配置任何点位。然而，用户说\"那几个温度\"，这暗示他们知道有一些温度点存在，只是可能没有显示出来。\n\n我需要先确认是否真的没有点位。可以尝试用类型过滤器查看，或者用户可能指的是已有的点位。让我用数字点过滤器再试一下，因为温度通常是模拟量点。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3553, "output_tokens": 450, "latency_ms": 12024.046000035014, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目中没有找到任何温度点位。要添加报警，首先需要创建温度点位（tags），然后才能配置报警。\n\n请提供以下信息：\n1. 温度点位的名称（tag），例如：TEMP_101, TEMP_102 等\n2. 每个温度点位的报警阈值（高限和/或低限）\n3. 报警优先级（高/中/低）\n4. 是否需要死区（deadband）设置\n\n例如：\"创建温度点位 TEMP_101，高限 85°C，低限 15°C，优先级高，死区 2°C\"", "reasoning": "当前处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可用工具包括manage_alarms、manage_points、manage_scripts、manage_pages和manage_graphics。用户说要\"给那几个温度加上报警\"。首先需要创建温度点位（tags），然后才能配置报警。但当前工作流步骤是discover_points，发现点位列表为空。因此需要先创建点位。然而，manage_points工具的create_point动作需要指定tag、type等参数。用户没有提供具体的温度点位名称，需要询问。\n\n根据行为准则，若信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。已调用list_points查询，结果为空。需要向用户确认具体的温度点位信息。\n\n应该询问用户：有哪些温度点位需要添加报警？需要提供tag名称、类型（可能是analog）、单位（如℃）等信息。另外还需要知道报警的阈值（高限、低限）、优先级等。\n\n但用户只说了\"那几个温度\"，可能之前已经定义过这些点位？不过查询结果显示为空。可能点位是在其他阶段创建的，或者用户指的是其他项目中的点位。需要澄清。\n\n另外，当前阶段是CONFIG_ALARM，但工作流上下文显示workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。这是配置报警的步骤，但需要先有温度点位。如果点位不存在，需要先创建。可以使用manage_points的create_point动作。\n\n但需要用户提供必要信息。先询问。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6458, "output_tokens": 698, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 25363.22499997914}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "3529b0aa-354c-4e9c-88aa-6d6c380db2d3", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-011", "text": "把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:10.862Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:20.203Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:10.862Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:23:20.203Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3217, "output_tokens": 404, "latency_ms": 9330.762500001583, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您想将主画面上的泵1控件绑定到\"马达3\"这个点位上。不过我需要确认几个信息才能完成绑定：\n\n1. **主画面的页面ID**是什么？（例如 `main_page`、`home` 等）\n2. **泵1控件的widget ID**是什么？（例如 `pump_1`、`pump01` 等）\n3. **绑定到哪个属性**？（例如 `value`、`status`、`color`、`visible` 等）\n\n请提供这些信息，我就可以为您完成点位绑定操作。", "reasoning": "The user wants to bind \"泵1\" (Pump 1) on the main page to \"马达3\" (Motor 3). This is a point-to-widget binding operation.\n\nLet me analyze the intent:\n- The user wants to bind a SCADA point tag (马达3) to a widget (泵1) on the main page\n- This would use the `manage_pages` tool with `bind_point` action\n\nHowever, I need more information:\n1. What is the page_id of the \"主画面\" (main page)?\n2. What is the widget_id of \"泵1\" (Pump 1)?\n3. What property of the pump widget should be bound? (e.g., value, color, status, etc.)\n\nThe user said \"把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上\" which means bind pump 1 on the main page to motor 3. I think \"马达3\" is the SCADA point tag they want to bind to the pump widget.\n\nI need to ask for clarification on:\n- The page_id for 主画面\n- The widget_id for 泵1\n- Which property to bind (usually for a pump, it might be \"value\" or \"status\")\n\nLet me ask the user for these details."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3217, "output_tokens": 404, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9340.32290003961}, "judge": null}
