5-pro", "input_tokens": 1024, "output_tokens": 253, "latency_ms": 5554.850699962117, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先了解一下当前项目中是否存在 PI-201 和 valve1 这两个点位，以及现有的脚本情况。让我先查询一下：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a new global script with an OnEvent trigger. The script logic should be: if PI-201 is too high, then set valve1.\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools, I can only:\n1. `manage_scripts` - but only with `list_scripts` action (list scripts, optionally filtered by trigger)\n2. `manage_points` - but only with `list_points` action (list points, optionally filtered by type)\n\nI cannot create scripts with the current allowed actions. I should first list the available points and scripts to understand the current state, then let the user know that I need to switch to a different phase to create the script.\n\nLet me first check what points and scripts are available to confirm PI-201 and valve1 exist."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3460, "output_tokens": 567, "latency_ms": 12443.955899972934, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "已确认：\n- **PI-201** 存在，类型为 analog（模拟量）\n- **valve1** 存在，类型为 digital（数字量）\n- 当前没有 on_event 类型的脚本\n\n我需要切换到 **CONFIG_SCRIPT** 阶段来创建脚本。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_SCRIPT\n\n---\n\n现在我来为您创建这个 OnEvent 全局脚本。脚本逻辑：当 PI-201 超过高限值（假设为 100）时，将 valve1 置位为 TRUE。", "reasoning": "The points exist:\n- PI-201: analog type\n- valve1: digital type\n\nCurrently there are no on_event scripts.\n\nNow I need to create the script. However, looking at my current allowed actions for manage_scripts, I only have `list_scripts` available. I cannot create scripts in the current ANALYZE_INTENT phase.\n\nI need to switch to the CONFIG_SCRIPT phase to be able to create scripts. Let me inform the user and switch phases.\n\nAccording to the behavior guidelines:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nThe available next states are: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nI should switch to CONFIG_SCRIPT."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4033, "output_tokens": 49, "latency_ms": 1602.2584000020288, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "脚本创建成功！让我确认一下：", "reasoning": "The script was created successfully. Let me confirm by listing the scripts again."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4119, "output_tokens": 75, "latency_ms": 2261.8816000176594, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "Hmm, the script list still shows 0 scripts. That's strange - the create action returned OK but the script doesn't appear in the list. Let me try listing without filter to see all scripts."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 12636, "output_tokens": 944, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23473.059399984777}, "judge": null}
