ag": "PumpB"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"binding": "pump_b_widget.value=PumpB"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b_widget.bindings.value": "PumpB"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.2738999901339412, "intended_entities": ["pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b_widget.bindings.value"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.pump_station", "pages.pump_station.widgets.pump_b_widget", "points.PumpB"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": "sha256:c8b73b52265a1f3a8e80b76ae428ebf284af1d62f7b464efb1f7dcfc1e9a4284", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 969, "output_tokens": 262, "latency_ms": 6558.696000021882, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你完成泵站画面的配置。首先让我查询一下当前的点位和页面信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create a new pump station page\n2. Add 2 pump widgets\n3. Bind them to PumpA and PumpB points\n\nLet me analyze what tools I have available:\n- manage_points: Only allows list_points currently\n- manage_pages: Only allows list_pages currently\n\nI need to:\n1. First check if PumpA and PumpB points exist\n2. Check existing pages\n3. Then create a new page with pump widgets and bind points\n\nHowever, looking at the available actions:\n- manage_points: only \"list_points\" is allowed\n- manage_pages: only \"list_pages\" is allowed\n\nI cannot create pages or widgets with the current allowed actions. Let me first query what exists (list points and pages) to understand the current state, and then inform the user about what actions are needed but not currently available.\n\nLet me start by listing the existing points and pages to understand the current state."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3928, "output_tokens": 234, "latency_ms": 4673.9690999966115, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 **PumpA** 和 **PumpB** 已存在（均为 digital 类型），目前还没有页面。现在我来创建泵站页面：", "reasoning": "Good, I can see:\n1. PumpA and PumpB points already exist as digital type points\n2. There are no pages yet\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Create a new pump station page\n2. Add 2 pump widgets to that page\n3. Bind PumpA and PumpB to the widgets\n\nLooking at the available actions for manage_pages:\n- create_page: Create a new HMI page\n- create_widget: Place a graphical widget on a page\n- bind_point: Bind a SCADA point tag to a widget property\n\nLet me start by creating the pump station page."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4199, "output_tokens": 209, "latency_ms": 6529.400500003248, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面创建成功！现在添加 2 个泵图元：", "reasoning": "Page created. Now I need to create 2 pump widgets and bind them to PumpA and PumpB."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4473, "output_tokens": 177, "latency_ms": 4371.261199994478, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵图元已添加！现在绑定点位：", "reasoning": "Both pump widgets created. Now I need to bind the points to the widgets. Pump widgets typically need to bind their \"value\" or \"status\" property to the point."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4715, "output_tokens": 242, "latency_ms": 5696.444200002588, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **泵站画面配置完成！** \n\n### 配置摘要\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | `pump_station` - 泵站监控画面 |\n| **分辨率** | 1920 × 1080 |\n| **背景色** | #F0F4F8 |\n\n### 图元与点位绑定\n\n| 图元 ID | 类型 | 位置 | 绑定点位 |\n|---------|------|------|----------|\n| `pump_a_widget` | pump | (300, 300) | **PumpA** → value |\n| `pump_b_widget` | pump | (700, 300) | **PumpB** → value |\n\n两个泵图元已水平排列，间隔 200px，分别绑定到 PumpA 和 PumpB 数字点位。运行时泵的状态会实时反映这两个点位的开关状态。\n\n如需添加更多元素（如管道、阀门、标签等），请告诉我！", "reasoning": "All done! Let me summarize what was created for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 18284, "output_tokens": 1124, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27853.412199998274}, "judge": null}
