{"trace_id": "377b4f45-86a6-4fee-8819-0d83501d0a3d", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-018", "text": "新建全局脚本，OnEvent触发，写一段逻辑如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:33:52.345Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:20.217Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:33:52.345Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:14.128Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_SCRIPT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:14.128Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:20.217Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "valve1", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.48379995860159397, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.34500000765547156, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0031999661587178707, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1024, "output_tokens": 246, "latency_ms": 9127.687900036108, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您创建这个全局脚本。首先让我查看当前的点位和脚本情况，确认 PI-201 和 valve1 是否已配置。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a new global script with OnEvent trigger. The logic should be: if PI-201 is too high, then set valve1.\n\nLet me first check the current context. I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage with workflow=ScriptConfig, step=pick_binding.\n\nThe available tools are:\n- manage_scripts: can only list_scripts currently\n- manage_points: can only list_points currently\n\nI cannot create scripts with the current tools - I can only list them. Let me first list the existing scripts and points to understand the current state, and then explain what needs to be done.\n\nActually, let me first check what points and scripts exist to provide context, then explain the situation to the user.\n\nLet me query both the points and scripts to understand the current state."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3453, "output_tokens": 589, "latency_ms": 12646.898099977989, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "很好！点位 **PI-201**（模拟量）和 **valve1**（数字量）都已存在。但是当前阶段（ScriptConfig/pick_binding）的工具只支持**查询**脚本和点位，不具备**创建脚本**的能力。\n\n要完成您的需求，我需要了解以下信息并切换到脚本配置阶段：\n\n### 📋 需求确认\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **脚本类型** | OnEvent（事件触发） |\n| **监控点位** | PI-201（模拟量） |\n| **输出点位** | valve1（数字量） |\n| **逻辑** | PI-201 > 阈值 → valve1 = TRUE |\n\n### ❓ 需要您确认\n1. **\"过高\"的阈值是多少？** 例如 PI-201 > 100 时算过高？\n2. **脚本 ID 和名称？** 例如 `id: \"protect_high_pi201\"`, `name: \"PI201高压保护\"`\n\n请提供以上信息，我将切换到 **CONFIG_SCRIPT** 阶段为您创建脚本。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_SCRIPT", "reasoning": "Good, the points PI-201 (analog) and valve1 (digital) already exist. There are no scripts currently.\n\nNow, the user wants to create a new script with:\n- Trigger: on_event\n- Logic: if PI-201 is too high, set valve1\n\nHowever, the current available tools only allow `list_scripts` and `list_points`. I cannot create scripts with the current toolset.\n\nI need to check what the user needs:\n1. The script should be on_event triggered\n2. It should read PI-201 (analog point)\n3. If PI-201 > some threshold, set valve1 = true (digital point)\n\nSince I can't create the script with current tools, I should explain this to the user and suggest switching to a different phase where script creation is possible.\n\nAccording to the behavior rules:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nThe available next states are: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nCONFIG_SCRIPT seems like the appropriate phase for creating scripts. Let me suggest switching to that phase.\n\nAlso, I need to ask about the threshold for \"过高\" (too high). What value constitutes \"too high\" for PI-201?"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4037, "output_tokens": 278, "latency_ms": 6084.780499979388, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的！我现在已进入 CONFIG_SCRIPT 阶段，具备创建脚本的能力。\n\n在创建脚本前，我仍需确认一个关键参数：\n\n### ❓ 请确认阈值\n\n**PI-201 过高的阈值是多少？**\n\n例如：PI-201 > 100 时将 valve1 置位？\n\n---\n\n脚本配置将如下设置：\n| 项目 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 脚本 ID | `protect_high_pi201` |\n| 脚本名称 | PI201高压保护 |\n| 触发方式 | on_event |\n| 监控点位 | PI-201 |\n| 输出点位 | valve1 |\n\n请告知阈值，我立即为您创建脚本。", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed I'm now in the CONFIG_SCRIPT phase. Looking at the available tools, I can now use `create_script` action from `manage_scripts`.\n\nHowever, I still need some information from the user:\n1. The threshold for \"过高\" (too high) - what value of PI-201 should trigger valve1\n2. Script ID and name (or I can suggest defaults)\n\nLet me ask the user for the threshold value. I can suggest default values for the script ID and name."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8514, "output_tokens": 1113, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 27871.75340001704}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "bbf453ed-a46d-4e61-823e-a659102f0b36", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-020", "text": "给我复制一份主画面，改名叫备用画面", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:21.028Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:22.867Z", "total_turns": 0, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:21.028Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:34:22.867Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7594b0d339dd171671a56b95048f5db7ed6f220f510a7a336df0828ff5aea13a", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 1839.154600049369}, "judge": null}
