"latency_ms": 6017.558799998369, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查看一下当前的页面列表，确认主画面的信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to copy the main page and rename it to \"备用画面\" (backup/standby screen).\n\nHowever, looking at the available tools, I don't see a \"copy_page\" action. The available actions for manage_pages are:\n- rename_page\n- list_pages\n- delete_page\n- create_page\n- create_widget\n\nThere's no direct \"copy_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" action available. \n\nLet me first list the pages to see what exists, then I can explain to the user what options are available. I could:\n1. List the pages to find the main page\n2. Create a new page called \"备用画面\"\n3. But I wouldn't be able to copy the widgets from the main page automatically\n\nLet me first list the pages to understand the current state, and then inform the user about the limitations."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3258, "output_tokens": 317, "latency_ms": 7048.577300040051, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前系统中只有一个页面：\n\n| ID | 名称 |\n|---|---|\n| main | 主画面 |\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 无法直接复制页面**\n\n很抱歉，当前工具不支持\"复制页面\"操作（即自动复制页面及其所有控件）。我只能提供以下替代方案：\n\n1. **新建一个空白的\"备用画面\"页面** —— 页面会是全新的，需要手动重新添加控件和绑定。\n2. **保持原样** —— 如果您只是想改名，我可以帮您将\"主画面\"改名为\"备用画面\"（但这样就没有主画面了）。\n\n请问您希望怎么处理？如果选择方案1，我可以立即为您创建一个空白的\"备用画面\"页面，之后再逐步添加所需的控件。", "reasoning": "OK, so there's one page called \"主画面\" with id \"main\". \n\nThe user wants to copy this page and rename it \"备用画面\". However, the available tools don't include a \"copy_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" action. I can only:\n- create_page (creates a blank page)\n- rename_page\n- delete_page\n- list_pages\n- create_widget\n\nI cannot copy a page with all its widgets. I should inform the user that the current tools don't support page duplication, and offer alternatives:\n1. Create a new blank page called \"备用画面\"\n2. Explain that widgets would need to be manually added\n\nI should be honest about the limitation and ask the user how they'd like to proceed.