 null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.3149000112898648, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.003700028173625469, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "bind_point"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["group_widgets", "apply_flow_layout", "create_rect", "delete_widget", "create_line"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "delete_alarm"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "create_page", "args": {"action": "create_page", "id": "pump_station", "name": "泵站画面", "resolution": [1920, 1080], "background": "#FFFFFF"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"page_id": "pump_station"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"pages.pump_station": {"id": "pump_station", "name": "泵站画面", "resolution": [1920, 1080], "background": "#FFFFFF", "widgets": {}}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.5449000163935125, "intended_entities": ["pages.pump_station"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:98327752e448e2768a1d5554e14583a307747a19d68f8b9f81b75d5bd3482296", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 969, "output_tokens": 394, "latency_ms": 10104.952300025616, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析您的需求：\n1. **新建泵站画面** - 需要创建HMI页面\n2. **添加2个泵图元** - 需要在页面上添加widget\n3. **绑定PumpA和PumpB点位** - 需要将点位与widget绑定\n\n首先，让我查询一下当前项目中的点位和页面情况，确认PumpA、PumpB点位是否存在，以及了解当前页面列表。", "reasoning": "用户想要新建一个泵站画面，添加2个泵图元，并分别绑定PumpA和PumpB点位。\n\n让我分析一下用户的需求：\n1. 新建一个\"泵站\"画面 - 这需要创建页面\n2. 添加2个泵图元 - 这需要在页面上添加widget\n3. 绑定点位PumpA和PumpB - 这需要有点位存在，然后进行绑定\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用的工具有：\n- manage_points: 只能执行 list_points（查询点位）\n- manage_pages: 只能执行 list_pages（查询页面）\n\n我需要先了解：\n1. 是否已经存在PumpA和PumpB这两个点位\n2. 当前有哪些页面\n\n所以我应该先调用这两个查询工具来获取当前状态，然后再决定下一步操作。\n\n但是，当前阶段的工具只能查询，不能创建页面或绑定点位。我需要：\n1. 先查询现有点位和页面\n2. 然后切换到合适的阶段来执行实际的创建和绑定操作\n\n让我先调用这两个查询工具来了解当前项目状态。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4060, "output_tokens": 273, "latency_ms": 7334.4773999997415, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "查询结果显示：\n\n✅ **点位状态**：PumpA 和 PumpB 都已存在（均为 digital 类型）\n📄 **页面状态**：当前项目中还没有任何页面\n\n要完成您的需求（创建页面、添加泵图元、绑定点位），需要切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段来执行实际的配置操作。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "很好，查询结果显示：\n1. 点位 PumpA 和 PumpB 已经存在，都是 digital 类型\n2. 当前没有任何页面\n\n现在我需要：\n1. 创建泵站画面页面\n2. 添加2个泵图元\n3. 绑定点位\n\n但是当前阶段（ANALYZE_INTENT）只能进行查询操作。要完成实际配置，我需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n根据可切换的下一阶段列表：\n- BIND_POINTS\n- CONFIG_ALARM\n- CONFIG_HISTORY\n- CONFIG_POINT\n- CONFIG_SCRIPT\n- DEPLOY\n- DONE\n- GENERATE_LAYOUT\n- MANAGE_PAGES\n- VALIDATE\n\n对于这个需求，我应该切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来创建页面和添加图元，然后到 BIND_POINTS 阶段来绑定点位。\n\n让我告诉用户查询结果，然后建议切换到合适的阶段来完成配置。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4346, "output_tokens": 290, "latency_ms": 7170.099100039806, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我现在可以执行配置操作了。按照以下步骤完成：\n\n1. **创建泵站画面页面**\n2. **添加2个泵图元**\n3. **分别绑定点位**\n\n让我先创建泵站页面：", "reasoning": "用户让我进入了 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。现在我需要完成：\n1. 创建泵站画面页面\n2. 添加2个泵图元\n3. 绑定 PumpA 和 PumpB 点位\n\n根据当前阶段的可用工具：\n- manage_pages: create_widget, create_page, bind_point\n\n我可以执行这些操作。让我按顺序来：\n\n1. 先创建页面（create_page）\n2. 添加2个泵图元（create_widget x2）\n3. 绑定点位（bind_point x2）\n\n这些操作是有依赖关系的：\n- 必须先创建页面才能在页面上添加widget\n- 必须先有widget才能绑定点位\n\n所以我应该先调用 create_page，然后等页面创建成功后再创建widget，最后绑定。\n\n让我先创建页面："}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9375, "output_tokens": 957, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 26340.642000024673}, "judge": null}
