绑定 PumpA 和 PumpB\n\n现在让我切换到页面创建阶段：\n\nnext_state: CREATE_PAGES", "reasoning": "Good, the points PumpA and PumpB already exist (both are digital type). There are no pages yet.\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Create a pump station page\n2. Add 2 pump widgets to the page\n3. Bind PumpA and PumpB to the widgets\n\nBut wait - the current tools for manage_pages only allow list_pages action, and manage_graphics only allow query action. I cannot actually create pages or widgets with the current available actions.\n\nI need to switch to a different stage that allows creating pages and widgets. Looking at the next_state options:\n- CREATE_POINTS\n- CREATE_GRAPHICS\n- CREATE_PAGES\n- ADD_WIDGETS\n- BIND_POINTS\n\nI should probably need to:\n1. First go to CREATE_PAGES to create the pump station page\n2. Then go to ADD_WIDGETS to add pump widgets\n3. Then go to BIND_POINTS to bind the points\n\nLet me switch to CREATE_PAGES first."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4879, "output_tokens": 527, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16765.96279995283}, "judge": null}
