分析用户意图，然后决定下一步。\n\n用户想要：\n1. 创建一个新的趋势页面（trend page）\n2. 在该页面上添加一个趋势图表（trend chart）\n3. 将趋势图表绑定到历史数据点\n\n根据工作流上下文，当前workflow=PointBinding，step=list_targets。这可能意味着我们正在处理点位绑定的工作流，当前步骤是列出目标（可能是点位或页面）。\n\n我需要先了解当前项目中有哪些页面和点位。让我调用list_pages和list_points来获取信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1474, "output_tokens": 132, "latency_ms": 5471.260600024834, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户现在处于 BIND_POINTS 阶段。当前可用的工具有：manage_pages（支持 bind_point 和 list_pages）和 manage_points（支持 list_points）。用户之前想要创建一个趋势页面，并添加趋势图表绑定历史数据。\n\n首先，我需要了解当前有哪些点位可用，因为用户想绑定历史数据。我先调用 manage_points 来列出所有点位。之前调用时 type_filter 参数有误，这次我应该不指定 type_filter，或者设为 null。让我试试看。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3970, "output_tokens": 580, "latency_ms": 15401.366100006271, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您创建趋势页面并绑定历史数据。首先我需要查看当前有哪些可用的点位（tags），以便进行绑定。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a trend page with a trend chart bound to historical data. I'm now in the BIND_POINTS stage.\n\nLooking at the available tools:\n1. **manage_pages** - can create_page, bind_point\n2. **manage_points** - can list_points\n\nBut wait - I don't see a \"trend chart\" widget type in the manage_pages tool. The bind_point action is for point↔widget binding, but I need to first create the page and widget.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the tools, I see:\n- manage_pages has: create_page, bind_point (from the stage info)\n- But the actual function schema shows: create_page, create_widget\n\nLet me re-read the available actions for manage_pages in BIND_POINTS stage: \"create_page, bind_point\"\n\nSo the workflow is:\n1. First create the page (trend page)\n2. Create a widget (trend chart) on that page\n3. Bind points to the widget\n\nWait, looking at the function definition again, manage_pages only has create_page and create_widget actions. The bind_point action mentioned in the stage description might be part of create_widget with expected_binding_types, or there might be a separate bind_point action.\n\nActually, I need to check - the function schema says:\n- create_page: Create a new HMI page\n- create_widget: Place a graphical widget on a page\n\nAnd create_widget has \"expected_binding_types\" parameter which seems related to point binding.\n\nLet me proceed step by step:\n1. First, I need to create the trend page\n2. Then create a trend widget on that page\n3. The binding to historical data would be through the widget configuration\n\nBut I also need to know what points are available. Let me try list_points without the type_filter parameter since it seems to be causing issues. Looking at the schema, list_points doesn't seem to have a type_filter parameter in the schema shown.\n\nWait, the error says \"list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\" - but I didn't pass any type_filter. \n\nI notice the manage_points function only has \"create_point\" action, yet the error suggests list_points exists. There might be a discrepancy between the function schema and the actual available actions. Let me try calling manage_points with just the action parameter to see what points are available, or I could proceed with creating the trend page first and then attempt to bind points afterward. I'll start by setting up the trend page and widget, then determine what bindings are possible."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4609, "output_tokens": 429, "latency_ms": 11216.266400006134, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户希望创建一个趋势页面，并添加趋势图表绑定历史数据。当前处于 BIND_POINTS 阶段，可用工具有：manage_pages（create_page, bind_point）和 manage_points（list_points）。不过，之前调用 manage_points 时出现了错误，提示 type_filter 需要是 'analog'、'digital' 或 'string'。但根据工具定义，list_points 动作并没有 type_filter 参数。这可能是个误解。让我再仔细看看工具定义：manage_points 只有一个动作 create_point。所以 list_points 可能不是一个有效的动作？但工具描述中提到 \"Create / update / delete / list SCADA points (tags)\"，所以也许 list_points 是一个有效的动作，只是参数不同。工具定义显示只有 create_point 动作。这可能是个不一致的地方。但为了