"schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0038999714888632298, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 212, "latency_ms": 6146.815299987793, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！要搞一套泵站控制台，包含启停控制和报警，我先了解一下当前项目的状态，看看已经有哪些点位和页面了。", "reasoning": "The user wants to set up a pump station control console with start/stop controls, and also configure alarms. This is a fairly comprehensive request.\n\nLet me analyze what they need:\n1. A pump station control console (HMI page)\n2. Start/stop controls (points for pump control)\n3. Alarm configuration\n\nBut first, I need to understand the current state of the project. Let me:\n1. List existing points to see what's already configured\n2. List existing pages to see the current HMI setup\n\nThis will help me understand what we're working with before making recommendations.\n\nLet me call both tools simultaneously since they're independent."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 212, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 7701.757699949667}, "judge": null}
