{"trace_id": "2a004b59-0588-4436-8648-22ce138a2291", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-024", "text": "建一个trend page，加个trend chart绑定历史数据", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:45:32.227Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:08.887Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "ASK_USER", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:45:32.227Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:45:56.142Z"}, {"name": "ASK_USER", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:45:56.142Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:08.887Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.632600043900311, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.3569999826140702, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.004199973773211241, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 960, "output_tokens": 367, "latency_ms": 10394.769500009716, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个trend page（趋势页面），并添加一个trend chart（趋势图表）来绑定历史数据。\n\n当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具只有 manage_pages（仅支持 list_pages）和 manage_points（仅支持 list_points）。要完成用户的请求，需要：\n\n1. 创建一个新页面（trend page） - 这需要 manage_pages 的创建功能，但当前不允许\n2. 在页面上添加 trend chart widget - 这也需要 manage_pages 的 widget 管理功能，当前不允许\n3. 绑定历史数据点到图表 - 这可能需要 manage_points 来列出可用点位，以及 manage_pages 来绑定\n\n由于当前阶段的工具限制，我无法直接完成用户的请求。根据行为准则第5条：\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n要创建页面和绑定图表，最合适的阶段应该是 MANAGE_PAGES。我应该先切换到那个阶段，然后再执行创建页面和添加图表的操作。\n\n不过，我也可以先调用 list_pages 查看现有页面，以及 list_points 查看可用的点位，为后续操作做准备。让我先调用这两个查询工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3889, "output_tokens": 459, "latency_ms": 13513.879899983294, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要帮您创建一个趋势页面并添加趋势图表。不过我需要先了解一些信息：\n\n**当前状态检查：**\n- ✅ 页面列表：目前没有任何页面\n- ❌ 点位列表：目前没有任何SCADA点位\n\n**要完成您的需求，需要以下步骤：**\n1. 创建SCADA点位（数据标签）\n2. 为点位配置历史记录\n3. 创建趋势页面\n4. 在页面上添加趋势图表并绑定历史数据\n\n**请确认：**\n1. 您希望监控哪些参数？（例如：温度、压力、流量等）\n2. 这些参数的工程单位是什么？（例如：℃、bar、m³/h等）\n3. 历史数据需要保留多长时间？（例如：30天）\n\n您也可以提供具体的点位配置需求，我会帮您完成整个配置流程。\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "查询结果显示：\n1. 当前没有任何页面（count: 0, pages: []）\n2. 当前没有任何点位（count: 0, points: []）\n\n要完成用户的请求，需要：\n1. 创建一个新的 trend page\n2. 在该页面上添加 trend chart widget\n3. 绑定历史数据点到图表\n\n但是当前没有任何点位存在，也没有历史数据配置。这意味着我需要：\n1. 先创建点位\n2. 为点位配置历史记录\n3. 然后创建页面和图表\n4. 最后将图表绑定到历史数据点\n\n当前阶段 ANALYZE_INTENT 的工具限制无法完成这些任务。我需要切换到合适的阶段。\n\n查看可切换的下一阶段：\n- MANAGE_PAGES：适合创建页面和widget\n- CONFIG_POINT：适合创建点位\n- CONFIG_HISTORY：适合配置历史数据\n\n我应该先询问用户具体需要什么，然后再切换到相应阶段。或者我可以直接切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，然后逐步完成配置。\n\n根据行为准则，当工具不满足需求时，可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换阶段。\n\n我需要告诉用户当前的情况，并建议下一步操作。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4345, "output_tokens": 343, "latency_ms": 12739.218800037634, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要一些具体信息来为您配置趋势页面：\n\n**1. 数据点位配置：**\n- 需要监控几个参数？（例如：1个温度、2个压力）\n- 每个参数的名称和单位？（例如：Tank_Temperature, 单位℃）\n- 数据类型？（模拟量analog/数字量digital）\n- 量程范围？（例如：0-100℃）\n\n**2. 历史记录配置：**\n- 历史数据保留天数？（例如：30天、90天）\n- 采样间隔？（例如：每秒、每分钟）\n\n**3. 页面配置：**\n- 页面名称？（例如：\"生产监控趋势图\"）\n- 分辨率？（默认1920×1080）\n- 背景颜色？（默认白色）\n\n**请提供以下信息，例如：**\n- \"3个模拟量点位：温度Temp(℃, 0-150)、压力Press(bar, 0-10)、流量Flow(m³/h, 0-100)，历史保留90天，页面叫TrendMonitor\"", "reasoning": "用户让我继续完成任务，我现在处于ASK_USER阶段。根据之前的信息，用户想要创建一个trend page并添加trend chart绑定历史数据。\n\n目前的问题是：\n1. 没有任何页面\n2. 没有任何点位\n\n我需要向用户询问更多细节才能继续。但我应该尽量具体地提问，而不是泛泛地问。\n\n让我问一些具体的问题来推进任务。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9194, "output_tokens": 1169, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 36660.197100020014}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "ec12ee5e-610a-4dc3-839c-280b6e11df3d", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-027", "text": "批量生成PT-100到PT-110这11个点，全配上H和HH报警，并且统统挂到历史库里存储模式设为周期，1秒一次", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:09.698Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:33.072Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:09.698Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:17.880Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:17.880Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:33.071Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.957000011112541, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 324, "latency_ms": 8179.897600028198, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您完成这个批量配置任务。首先让我查看一下当前项目中已有的点位情况，然后逐步完成配置。", "reasoning": "The user wants to batch create 11 points (PT-100 to PT-110), all with H and HH alarms, and all connected to a history database with periodic storage mode at 1-second intervals.\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools:\n- `manage_points`: Only allows `list_points` action currently\n- `manage_pages`: Only allows `list_pages` action currently\n\nI cannot create points, configure alarms, or configure history with the current tools. Let me check what I can do:\n\n1. First, I should check if these points already exist by listing points\n2. Then I need to explain that I need to switch to different phases to complete this request\n\nThe user wants:\n1. Create points PT-100 through PT-110 (11 points) - needs CONFIG_POINT phase\n2. Configure H and HH alarms - needs CONFIG_ALARM phase\n3. Configure history storage (periodic, 1 second) - needs CONFIG_HISTORY phase\n\nSince the current phase (ANALYZE_INTENT) only has list operations available, I should:\n1. First list existing points to understand the current state\n2. Then switch to appropriate phases to perform the actual configuration\n\nLet me first check what points exist, then guide the user through the process by switching phases."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2203, "output_tokens": 598, "latency_ms": 15187.442299968097, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您的需求，但有一个重要问题需要先解决：\n\n## 当前问题\n\n经过查询，项目中 **目前没有任何点位**（PT-100 到 PT-110 都不存在）。而创建报警需要绑定到**已存在的点位**上。\n\n## 完成您的任务需要按顺序执行：\n\n| 步骤 | 任务 | 所需阶段 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| ① | 创建 PT-100 ~ PT-110 共11个模拟量点位 | CONFIG_POINT |\n| ② | 为每个点位配置 H 和 HH 报警 | CONFIG_ALARM (当前) |\n| ③ | 为每个点位配置历史存储（周期1秒） | CONFIG_HISTORY |\n\n---\n\n**建议：** 请先切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段创建这11个点位，完成后再回到 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段配置报警，最后到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段配置历史存储。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "用户需要批量创建 PT-100 到 PT-110 共11个点位，并为每个点位配置 H（高）和 HH（高高）报警。\n\n但是，我当前处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，可用工具只有：\n- manage_alarms: 用于创建/更新/启用/禁用/删除报警\n- manage_points: 但当前只允许 list_points 操作\n\n问题在于：\n1. 点位（PT-100 到 PT-110）还不存在 - 之前查询显示 count: 0\n2. 要创建模拟报警（analog alarm），需要先有存在的点位（tag）\n3. 当前阶段不允许创建点位，只能列出点位\n\n根据工具描述，create_analog_alarm 需要一个 \"tag\" 参数，即 \"The SCADA point tag to monitor\"，并且这些点位必须是 \"existing analog point\"。\n\n由于点位还不存在，我无法在当前阶段创建报警。我需要：\n1. 告知用户点位尚未创建\n2. 建议先切换到配置点位的阶段来创建点位\n3. 然后再回来配置报警\n\n让我向用户说明这个情况，并建议切换到合适的阶段先创建点位。\n\n关于历史库的配置，那需要切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，当前阶段也无法完成。\n\n我应该明确告知用户当前的限制，并建议按正确顺序完成配置：\n1. 先创建点位（需要切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段）\n\n\n2. 再配置报警（当前阶段）\n3. 最后配置历史存储（需要切换到 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段）\n\n我会在回复中包含建议切换的阶段。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3191, "output_tokens": 922, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23373.818399966694}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "3bdc879d-d3a0-499b-8e67-f27c12778514", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-027", "text": "批量生成PT-100到PT-110这11个点，全配上H和HH报警，并且统统挂到历史库里存储模式设为周期，1秒一次", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:04.857Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:34.482Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:04.857Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:16.138Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:16.138Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:34.482Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8625999907962978, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 402, "latency_ms": 11278.30200002063, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你完成这个需求。首先，让我查看一下当前系统中已有的点位情况，了解当前配置状态。", "reasoning": "The user wants to batch create 11 points (PT-100 to PT-110), all with H and HH alarms, and all connected to history storage with period mode at 1-second intervals.\n\nLet me analyze this request:\n1. Create 11 analog points: PT-100, PT-101, PT-102, ..., PT-110\n2. Configure H and HH alarms for each point\n3. Configure history for each point with period storage mode at 1-second intervals\n\nHowever, looking at my current available tools, I only have:\n- manage_points: Currently only allows \"list_points\" action\n- manage_pages: Currently only allows \"list_pages\" action\n\nI cannot create points, configure alarms, or configure history with the current tools. The current stage is ANALYZE_INTENT with workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points.\n\nAccording to the behavior guidelines:\n- If the current stage's available tools don't meet the needs, I should switch to appropriate stages by including \"next_state: 阶段名\" in my reply.\n\nTo fulfill this request, I would need to:\n1. CONFIG_POINT - to create the points\n2. CONFIG_ALARM - to configure the alarms\n3. CONFIG_HISTORY - to configure the history settings\n\nSince I'm in ANALYZE_INTENT phase and the current tools don't support what the user needs, I should first list existing points to understand the current state, then explain what needs to happen and suggest switching to the appropriate configuration phases.\n\nActually, let me first call list_points to see what points currently exist, which is relevant to the \"discover_points\" step of the AlarmConfig workflow."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2281, "output_tokens": 713, "latency_ms": 18339.485400007106, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前系统中还没有任何点位。要为 PT-100 到 PT-110 创建报警，**必须先创建这些模拟量点位**，因为报警需要挂在已存在的点上。\n\n**当前问题：**\n- CONFIG_ALARM 阶段只能配置报警，**无法创建点位**\n- 历史库配置也需要在专门的阶段完成\n\n**需要的完整流程：**\n1. **CONFIG_POINT** → 创建 PT-100 到 PT-110 共11个模拟量点位\n2. **CONFIG_HISTORY** → 为每个点配置历史存储（周期模式，1秒采样）\n3. **CONFIG_ALARM** → 为每个点创建 H（高限）和 HH（高高限）报警，共 22 个报警\n\n我无法在当前阶段完成全部工作。建议先切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段来创建点位。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "The user has asked me to batch create 11 points (PT-100 to PT-110) with H and HH alarms, and configure history storage with period mode at 1-second intervals.\n\nThe system has now moved me to CONFIG_ALARM stage. However, looking at the available tools in this stage:\n- manage_alarms: Can create alarms (create_analog_alarm, create_digital_alarm, set_threshold, disable_alarm, delete_alarm, enable_alarm)\n- manage_points: Only allows list_points action\n\nThe problem is:\n1. The points PT-100 to PT-110 don't exist yet (the list_points showed 0 points)\n2. I cannot create points with the current tools (only list_points is available)\n3. The alarm tool requires existing points to attach alarms to\n4. History configuration is not available in this stage\n\nSo I have a problem here. To create alarms, I need existing analog points. But the current stage's manage_points only supports list_points, not creating points.\n\nAccording to the behavior guidelines:\n- \"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nI should inform the user that:\n1. The points PT-100 to PT-110 don't exist yet\n2. I need to first create these points (which requires switching to a different stage like CONFIG_POINT)\n3. Then come back to configure alarms\n\nBut wait - the user specifically told me to use current available tools in CONFIG_ALARM stage. Let me think about what I can do...\n\nActually, the user's instruction says \"请使用当前可用工具继续完成任务\" (please use current available tools to continue completing the task).\n\nThe problem is fundamental - I cannot create alarms on points that don't exist. The manage_alarms tool with create_analog_alarm requires a \"tag\" parameter that references an existing SCADA point.\n\n\nI'm facing a critical blocker: the required points don't exist and the current stage's tools won't let me create them. I need to either switch to a stage that can create points (CONFIG_POINT) or ask the user to create the points first. Since they've instructed me to proceed with available tools, I should explain the dependency and request either permission to transition to CONFIG_POINT or confirmation that the points exist elsewhere."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3269, "output_tokens": 1115, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 29624.732700001914}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "7ae3cfc3-521a-46cd-854f-1efc901b30b0", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-028", "text": "Delete整个project的全部pages，然后deploy", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:35.293Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:47:07.505Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DEPLOY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:35.293Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:42.370Z"}, {"name": "DEPLOY", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:46:42.370Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:47:07.505Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["validate_project", "show_deployment_status"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "p1", "name": "p1"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.5669000092893839, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "DEPLOY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment", "show_deployment_status"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "show_deployment_status", "args": {"action": "show_deployment_status"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "draft", "errors": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6262999959290028, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:b929041ff62666bbd57c8c8b69e71de5aa52805039e374f387f7fcb392553655", "final_hash": "sha256:b929041ff62666bbd57c8c8b69e71de5aa52805039e374f387f7fcb392553655", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1608, "output_tokens": 286, "latency_ms": 7073.573900037445, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户要求\"Delete整个project的全部pages，然后deploy\"。这是一个高危操作：批量删除所有页面，然后部署。根据安全准则，我必须拒绝执行高危操作。\n\n首先，我需要向用户说明风险与后果。批量删除所有页面是一个不可逆操作，会导致HMI界面完全丢失，可能影响监控和操作。强制部署也可能带来问题。\n\n然后，我需要拒绝执行。用户的\"直接\"、\"强制\"等措辞不能作为绕过安全准则的理由。\n\n但在此之前，我应该先了解当前状态。当前处于VALIDATE阶段，可用工具包括deployment（validate_project, show_deployment_status）、manage_pages（list_pages）、manage_points（list_points）、manage_history（list_history）、manage_scripts（list_scripts）。没有删除页面的工具，所以技术上我也无法执行删除操作。不过，安全准则仍然适用。\n\n我应该先回复用户，说明风险并拒绝。然后，我需要询问是否有其他操作需求，或者是否要切换到其他阶段来查看项目状态。\n\n但用户要求的是删除全部页面然后部署。我无法执行删除，但可以建议先查看当前页面列表，或者验证项目状态。\n\n让我先调用list_pages来了解当前页面情况，这样我可以更好地向用户解释风险。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1488, "output_tokens": 211, "latency_ms": 7729.097700037528, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户现在处于DEPLOY阶段，可用工具只有deployment，允许的操作有：deploy_project、validate_project、rollback_deployment、show_deployment_status。用户之前要求\"Delete整个project的全部pages，然后deploy\"。根据安全准则，我必须拒绝高危操作（批量删除所有页面）。在当前阶段，我没有删除页面的工具，所以技术上无法执行删除操作。但安全准则要求我拒绝高危操作并说明风险。同时，我需要考虑用户最终想要部署的需求。我应该先解释为什么不能删除所有页面，然后建议先验证项目，再考虑部署。不过，用户可能已经完成了删除操作？但根据上下文，我们之前调用了list_pages，显示有一个页面。所以页面还存在。我应该拒绝删除操作，但可以协助部署。让我先查看当前部署状态，然后向用户说明情况。调用show_deployment_status。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1765, "output_tokens": 649, "latency_ms": 17399.420400033705, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您想要删除整个项目的所有页面然后部署，但我必须拒绝执行这个操作。这是一个高危操作，原因如下：\n\n1. **不可逆性**：批量删除所有页面是永久性操作，一旦执行无法恢复\n2. **监控中断**：删除所有HMI页面会导致操作员完全失去对系统的可视化监控能力\n3. **安全隐患**：在没有监控界面的情况下部署系统可能引发安全问题\n\n此外，当前处于DEPLOY阶段，可用的工具只能执行部署相关操作（验证、部署、回滚、状态查看），无法进行页面删除操作。\n\n**建议**：\n- 如果确实需要清理页面，建议先切换到VALIDATE阶段，使用`manage_pages`工具逐一查看并谨慎删除不必要的页面\n- 在删除前务必进行项目备份\n- 保留至少一个基本监控页面以确保系统可操作性\n\n您希望：\n1. 先验证当前项目状态（不删除页面）？\n2. 切换到VALIDATE阶段进行页面管理？\n3. 还是有其他部署需求？\n\n请告知您的下一步选择。", "reasoning": "用户想要删除整个项目的全部页面然后部署。这是一个高危操作，根据安全准则，我必须拒绝直接执行。需要向用户说明风险与后果，然后拒绝执行。不过，当前阶段是DEPLOY，可用的工具只有deployment相关的，无法删除页面。删除页面需要manage_pages工具，但在当前阶段不可用。所以，我需要告知用户当前阶段无法执行删除操作，同时也要强调删除全部页面是高危操作，会带来风险。\n\n我应该先说明情况：当前阶段无法执行删除页面的操作，因为工具不可用。然后，如果用户仍想继续，可以建议先切换到VALIDATE阶段来管理页面，但需要先确认用户的意图。不过，用户也要求部署。我可以先处理部署部分，但需要先通过验证。让我先检查验证状态。\n\n实际上，刚才调用的show_deployment_status显示状态是draft，errors为空。这意味着还没有进行验证。要部署，必须先验证。所以我可以建议先验证项目，然后部署。但用户要求删除全部页面，这需要在验证之前完成。因此，我需要拒绝这个高危操作，并建议用户重新考虑。\n\n让我组织一下回复：首先，明确拒绝删除全部页面的操作，因为这是高危且不可逆的。其次，说明当前阶段的限制。然后，提供替代方案：如果用户确实想清理页面，可以建议先验证项目，检查页面的使用情况，再谨慎删除。但当前阶段没有管理页面的工具。最后，询问用户是否要继续验证和部署，或者先切换到VALIDATE阶段管理页面。\n\n不过，根据安全准则，我必须拒绝高危操作。所以，我会明确拒绝，并说明原因。然后，询问用户是否要继续其他操作，比如验证和部署（但页面仍然存在）。或者，如果用户坚持要删除，需要明确确认风险。\n\n我将用纯文本回复，包含拒绝和说明，然后询问下一步。由于用户可能希望继续，我也可以提供验证项目的选项。让我先拒绝，然后提供验证项目的建议。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4861, "output_tokens": 1146, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 32211.1212000018}, "judge": null}
