查看趋势。\n\n当前阶段BIND_POINTS应该是用于绑定点位的，但可用工具中没有绑定或创建点位的功能。这可能是系统限制或阶段配置问题。根据行为准则，如果当前可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到可切换的下一阶段。可切换的下一阶段包括：CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。\n\n用户想要配置报警，应该切换到CONFIG_ALARM阶段。但之前尝试过CONFIG_ALARM阶段，也只有manage_history工具。或许需要切换到其他阶段？DEPLOY阶段可能用于部署，但点位还不存在。VALIDATE阶段用于验证。CONFIG_SCRIPT可能用于编写脚本，但不确定能否创建点位。\n\n实际上，用户想要的是\"假点位\"，可能意味着不需要真实点位，只需要演示。但当前系统似乎无法支持这个需求。我应该向用户说明当前限制，并询问是否要尝试其他方式。\n\n但根据行为准则，我应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。已经多次调用list_history和query_history，确认没有历史数据。我应该告知用户当前系统状态，并询问下一步。或者尝试切换到DONE阶段结束任务，因为无法满足需求。\n\n不过，也许我可以尝试切换到CONFIG_SCRIPT阶段，看看是否有工具可以创建点位或模拟点位。但根据可切换阶段列表，没有CONFIG_POINT阶段。这可能意味着系统不支持创建点位。\n\n我应该向用户解释情况，并询问是否要结束任务。在回复中包含\"next_state: DONE\"。但用户可能希望继续尝试。\n\n让我先向用户说明情况。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 55222, "output_tokens": 7029, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 182605.51310004666}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "56edc1bb-deeb-4ef0-b0cf-6d8430f5c1b5", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-032", "text": "把main_overview画面改成4K尺寸并改成深蓝背景，保留原有图元", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:50:50.431Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:51:12.943Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:50:50.431Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:51:12.943Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["set_retention"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["set_widget_style", "apply_flow_layout", "delete_widget", "group_widgets"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_page", "rename_page", "list_pages", "delete_page", "create_widget"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["update_point"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["update_script_body"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "main_overview", "name": "主画面"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.541199988219887, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:6143d1aca46d6dac930555852318ff3024607ff1988787840e5e089670c0b54f", "final_hash": "sha256:6143d1aca46d6dac930555852318ff3024607ff1988787840e5e089670c0b54f", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2984, "output_tokens": 386, "latency_ms": 9748.728399979882, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查看一下当前项目的页面列表，确认 main_overview 页面的信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to modify the \"main_overview\" page to:\n1. Change resolution to 4K (3840x2160)\n2. Change background to dark blue\n3. Keep existing widgets\n\nLooking at my available tools, I need to check what actions are available for manage_pages:\n- create_page: Create a new page with resolution and background\n- rename_page: Change display name\n- list_pages: Return list of pages\n- delete_page: Delete a page\n- create_widget: Place a widget on a page\n\nI don't see an \"update_page\" or \"modify_page\" action that would allow me to change the resolution and background of an existing page while keeping its widgets.\n\nThe closest option would be to:\n1. First list pages to find the page ID for \"main_overview\"\n2. Then... I don't have a direct tool to update page properties\n\nSince I don't have an update_page action in my available tools, I should inform the user about this limitation. However, let me first list the pages to understand the current state.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the tools available, I don't have a way to modify an existing page's resolution and background directly. The create_page action is for creating new pages, not updating existing ones.\n\nI should:\n1. First list the pages to confirm the page exists and get its ID\n2. Then explain to the user that I cannot directly modify the page resolution/background with the current available tools, OR\n3. I could potentially suggest switching to a different stage that might have more capabilities\n\nLet me first list the pages to get information, then determine the best course of action."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3422, "output_tokens": 561, "latency_ms": 12754.105100000743, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已确认 `main_overview` 页面存在（显示名称为\"主画面\"）。\n\n**遗憾的是**，当前阶段我可用的页面管理工具仅支持以下操作：\n- 创建新页面 (`create_page`)\n- 重命名页面 (`rename_page`)\n- 列出页面 (`list_pages`)\n- 删除页面 (`delete_page`)\n- 创建图元 (`create_widget`)\n\n**我没有\"更新/修改已有页面属性\"的工具**，无法直接修改现有页面的分辨率和背景色。\n\n---\n\n### 可选方案：\n\n| 方案 | 说明 | 风险 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **A. 跳转到配置阶段** | 切换到下一阶段，可能有页面属性编辑能力 | 需确认下一阶段是否有对应工具 |\n| **B. 重建页面** | 删除后重建同ID页面，再手动恢复图元 | ⚠️ 会丢失所有现有图元及其配置 |\n| **C. 手动操作** | 在 SCADA 设计器界面中直接修改页面属性 | 需您自行操作 |\n\n**我建议选择方案 A**，尝试切换到其他阶段看看是否有页面属性编辑能力。\n\n您希望我：\n1. 尝试切换到下一阶段寻找更多工具？\n2. 还是您在 SCADA 设计器中手动修改页面属性（分辨率改为 `3840×2160`，背景色改为深蓝如 `#0A1929`）？\n\n请告诉我您的选择。", "reasoning": "I found the page \"main_overview\" with name \"主画面\". However, looking at my available tools for manage_pages, I only have:\n- create_page\n- rename_page\n- list_pages\n- delete_page\n- create_widget\n\nThere's no \"update_page\" or \"modify_page_properties\" action that would allow me to change the resolution and background of an existing page while keeping its widgets.\n\nThe only way I could potentially achieve this with my current tools would be to:\n1. Delete the page (which would also delete all widgets - this violates the user's requirement to keep existing widgets)\n2. Create a new page with the same ID but different resolution/background\n3. Then recreate all widgets\n\nBut this approach would:\n- Lose all existing widgets (user explicitly said to keep them)\n- Be a destructive operation that I should avoid\n\nI should inform the user that I don't have the capability to modify page properties (resolution, background) with my current available tools. The user might need to use a different interface or I might need to switch to a different stage that has more capabilities.\n\nLet me inform the user about this limitation."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6406, "output_tokens": 947, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22511.363900033757}, "judge": null}
