al_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:6b7958e19d8ed26c24fa0e8fdb94fa15cc383bfaeb4298e6e4a954e08a0fbfe2", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2872, "output_tokens": 166, "latency_ms": 4211.468199966475, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为您创建泵A启停控制的数字量命令点。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a new digital command point called \"PUMP_A_CMD\" for controlling pump A start/stop.\n\nI should use the manage_points tool with the create_point action to create this digital point. This is a digital (boolean) type point used for command/control of pump A.\n\nLet me create this point with appropriate parameters:\n- tag: PUMP_A_CMD\n- type: digital\n- description: Pump A start/stop command"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3073, "output_tokens": 142, "latency_ms": 5683.13980003586, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **数字量命令点创建成功！**\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 标签名 | `PUMP_A_CMD` |\n| 类型 | digital（数字量） |\n| 说明 | 泵A启停控制命令点 |\n\n该点位已可用于：\n- HMI 画面绑定（如启动/停止按钮）\n- 报警配置\n- 脚本逻辑联动\n- 历史数据记录\n\n如需进一步配置（例如添加泵状态反馈点、设置联锁报警、绑定到画面控件等），请告诉我！", "reasoning": "The point was created successfully. Let me confirm to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 5945, "output_tokens": 308, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9904.697299993131}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "970816df-7d15-4b0c-bced-cad352296181", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:903551a10ddac6a9ecda5d88d283fc6355054dc2bc38268249c8417c4dd55398", "code_commit": "6394c3bbfd392dd5cbb460ae6dff0b9b96eb4037", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-035", "text": "帮我改一下那个画面，颜色好看点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "page"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-15T04:53:33.198Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-15T04:53:49.192Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:53:33.198Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:53:37.836Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-15T04:53:37.836Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-15T04:53:49.192Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "list_pages", "create_page"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8916999795474112, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1283, "output_tokens": 66, "latency_ms": 4632.721699948888, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户希望修改某个画面的颜色，让其更好看。我需要先了解当前有哪些页面，然后才能确定要修改哪个页面。让我先调用 list_pages 来查看现有页面列表。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1848, "output_tokens": 423, "latency_ms": 11353.490900015458, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前系统中还没有任何页面。您提到想要修改一个画面的颜色，但需要先确认以下信息：\n\n1. **您想要修改哪个页面？** 请提供页面名称或ID，或者您是否需要先创建一个新页面？\n2. **具体想要修改哪些元素的颜色？** 比如背景、某个图形、文字等。\n3. **您希望使用什么颜色？** 请提供具体的颜色偏好（如蓝色、绿色、渐变色等）。\n\n如果您需要创建新页面，我需要先切换到MANAGE_PAGES阶段来创建页面，然后再配置图形布局和样式。请告诉我您的具体需求。", "reasoning": "目前没有页面。用户想要修改一个画面的颜色，但首先需要有页面。也许用户指的是之前创建的页面？但根据查询结果，页面数量为零。我需要向用户确认具体是哪个页面。同时，用户提到了“颜色好看点”，这意味着他们可能想要修改现有图形元素的样式。然而，当前阶段（GENERATE_LAYOUT）的可用工具是 create_circle、create_rect、create_text、create_line，这些工具只能创建图形，不能修改已有的图形。但样式属性可以在创建时指定。所以，如果页面不存在，我需要先创建页面，但 manage_pages 工具在当前阶段只允许 list_pages 操作，无法创建页面。也许页面已经存在，只是没有显示？或者我需要切换到其他阶段来管理页面？根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具无法满足需求，可以在回复中包含“next_state: 阶段名”来切换到下一阶段。可切换的下一阶段有：BIND_POINTS、DEPLOY、DONE、MANAGE_PAGES、VALIDATE。其中 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段可能包含创建页面的功能。但用户的问题是修改颜色，这可能涉及图形编辑。不过，也许我可以先创建一个新的图形元素，并指定好看的颜色。但用户说的是“改一下那个画面”，这暗示着修改现有的画面。我需要更多信息。让我向用户询问具体细节。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "GraphicsLayout"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3131, "output_tokens": 489, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 15993.779799959157}, "judge": null}
