sha256:5a2353e6593461f42f0035dfd8b0fda32b2d6071b4a7a418f6195248f485c2bc", "final_hash": "sha256:49ba7cb099a8a045547656b78db2a602314512c285e65cea6c07beefdbfc25bc", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 173, "latency_ms": 4095.5858000088483, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先确认页面和点位是否存在，然后才能进行绑定操作。让我先查询一下。", "reasoning": "The user wants to add a pump widget to the \"pump_panel\" page and bind points to it:\n1. Add pump A widget to pump_panel page\n2. Bind running status to PUMP_A_RUN\n3. Bind frequency to PUMP_A_HZ\n\nFirst, I need to check:\n1. What pages exist (to confirm pump_panel exists)\n2. What points exist (to confirm PUMP_A_RUN and PUMP_A_HZ exist)\n\nLet me call both tools to get this information first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3873, "output_tokens": 257, "latency_ms": 5195.5408999929205, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "很好！页面和点位都已确认存在：\n- **页面**: `pump_panel` (泵面板)\n- **点位**: `PUMP_A_RUN` (数字量) 和 `PUMP_A_HZ` (模拟量)\n\n现在为您创建泵A图元并绑定点位：", "reasoning": "The page \"pump_panel\" exists and the points PUMP_A_RUN (digital) and PUMP_A_HZ (analog) also exist. Now I can:\n\n1. Create a pump widget on pump_panel page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the pump's running status (likely \"status\" or \"value\" property)\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the pump's frequency (likely \"frequency\" property)\n\nLet me first create the pump widget. I'll use a reasonable position and size."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4182, "output_tokens": 204, "latency_ms": 4478.781400015578, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵A图元已创建成功，现在绑定两个点位：", "reasoning": "Good, the pump widget was created. Now I need to bind the two points:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN to the pump's status (running status)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ to the pump's frequency\n\nI can make both binding calls at once since they're independent."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4466, "output_tokens": 201, "latency_ms": 4765.202299982775, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 泵A图元已添加并完成点位绑定：\n\n| 配置项 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|\n| **页面** | `pump_panel` (泵面板) |\n| **图元** | `pump_A` (类型: pump，位置: 200,150，大小: 120×120) |\n| **运行状态绑定** | `status` ← `PUMP_A_RUN` (数字量) |\n| **频率绑定** | `frequency` ← `PUMP_A_HZ` (模拟量，单位: Hz) |\n\n泵A图元现在会实时显示运行状态和频率数据。您还需要对这个泵进行其他配置吗？例如：\n- 添加报警配置\n- 编写运行脚本\n- 调整图元样式或位置", "reasoning": "All operations completed successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 13493, "output_tokens": 835, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18560.238699952606}, "judge": null}
